<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7648"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Verm_inve<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Verm_inve<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 16, 2005 - 11:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Kansas Girl: <BR> <BR>Is there not a transcript or video of the information released?  I&#39;ve looked for one, but can not seem to find it.   I would love to hear it ... <BR> <BR>If the jewelry is from Davis then it is more than likely what we feared.  Davis is an unfortunate victim of the BTK, and his MO had changed slightly ... <BR> <BR>However if it is true that the BTK believes his only MO needs to be to Bind, Torture, and Kill ... then he has done nothing outside his perceived MO. <BR> <BR>Was there any word on the very similiar case of Hedge?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
