<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8495"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Km<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Km<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 8:47 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I am more convinced than ever that BTK killed Dee Davis.  Ms. Davis&#39;s son said he thinks another person did it but they couldn&#39;t make a case against him.  Could it be that the &#34;other guy&#34; and BTK are the same person?  I hope the cops take another look at their original suspect, talk with him some more, and swab him if they haven&#39;t already.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
